I heard the Pristonians went to the bottom of the sea and have already faced the troops of Yagditha, the ruler of the seas.
The Royal Council formed an alliance with the water people who oppose Yagditha. Midranda remains hidden.

Several Black Crystals appeared on the Shadow Road and across the continent. A strange signal is coming from them. The Master Witches are guarding them. It may be connected to Midranda; I need you to look into it.

[Challenge Objective]

Take the Black Crystal by hunting the Master Witch on the Shadow Road.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Shaman on the Road to the Wind.
